cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the generated dataset, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "CAD-RADS report generator: parameterizable synthetic CCTA reports for LLM research"
abstract: >-
  Open-source Python tool that generates parameterizable synthetic coronary CT
  angiography (CCTA) reports with CAD-RADS 2.0 labels. The CAD-RADS category is
  computed deterministically from the lesion scenario by a rule engine, then
  imposed on the language model, so that the released corpus is internally
  consistent by construction. Optional realistic minor incidental findings.
authors:
